description: XML layouts, drawables, strings, colors, and themes
globs: ["**/res/**/*.xml"]
alwaysApply: false
---

## Layout naming (snake_case)

| Prefix | Usage |
|--------|-------|
| `fragment_` | Screen layouts |
| `activity_` | Activities |
| `item_` | RecyclerView rows |
| `dialog_` | Dialogs |
| `bottom_sheet_` | Bottom sheets |
| `layout_` | Reusable include blocks |

Example: `fragment_home.xml`, `item_language.xml`

## View ID naming (prefix + camelCase)

| Prefix | Widget |
|--------|--------|
| `mb` | MaterialButton |
| `mtv` | MaterialTextView |
| `mcv` | MaterialCardView |
| `cl` | ConstraintLayout |
| `rcv` | RecyclerView |
| `fcv` | FragmentContainerView |
| `bnv` | BottomNavigationView |

Pattern: `{prefix}{Role}{Context}` → `mtvHeadingHome`, `mbContinueLogin`

## Drawable naming

| Prefix | Usage |
|--------|-------|
| `ic_svg_` | Vector icons |
| `ic_png_` | Raster icons |
| `bg_shape_` | Shape / selector backgrounds (XML shapes) |
| `bg_svg_` | Backgrounds imported as SVG/vector |
| `bg_` | Other backgrounds / selectors (when not shape/svg) |
| `fg_` | Foreground overlays / gradients |
| `img_svg_` / `img_png_` | Large illustrations |
| `flag_` | Language / country flags when used |

Examples: `bg_shape_rounded_primary.xml`, `bg_svg_onboarding_header.xml`, `fg_gradient_header.xml`

## Fonts and motion

- Fonts in shared UI module (`res/font/`) + `preloaded_fonts.xml` when using downloadable/preloaded fonts
- Transitions: `res/anim/` (and `anim-ldrtl/` for RTL flips)
- Night-specific assets: `drawable-night/`, `values-night/` — avoid duplicating full layouts for dark mode

## Strings (single source of truth)

- **All** user-facing strings live in **one** shared module file (e.g. `:core-ui` `values/strings.xml`) — not scattered across `:presentation` or feature modules
- Keeps localization simple: translate one file (plus `values-xx/` mirrors)
- No hardcoded user-facing text in layouts or Kotlin
- Patterns: `toast_*`, `action_*`, `{screen}_title`, `{feature}_*`
- Non-translatable config: `translatable="false"`

## Colors and themes

- Material 3 DayNight theme as base
- Semantic color names: `colorPrimary`, `colorTextTitle`, `colorTextBody`
- Prefer theme attributes in layouts: `?attr/colorSurface`
- Light/dark via `values` + `values-night` — avoid duplicating full layouts

## Orientation (mandatory)

- UI must support **both portrait and landscape**
- Do not lock Activities to a single orientation unless explicitly required by product
- Use ConstraintLayout / responsive constraints so layouts adapt; add `layout-land/` (or dimension/guideline tweaks) when portrait-only XML cannot adapt cleanly
- Test critical screens in both orientations before considering a feature done

## Layout rules

- Prefer **Material** widgets whenever possible (`MaterialTextView`, `MaterialButton`, `MaterialCardView`, …) — not plain `TextView`/`Button` when a Material equivalent exists
- **View Binding only** — never `findViewById`, never Data Binding
- Keep layouts **simple and shallow** — minimize nesting to avoid overdraw / measure performance issues
- ConstraintLayout as primary layout engine; avoid deep LinearLayout/RelativeLayout trees
- RecyclerView: `ListAdapter` + `DiffUtil`, inflate via View Binding
- Shared styles in core-ui — reuse over one-off attributes
- `dp` for layout, `sp` for text